# Documentation & Contribution Standards

## 📝 Documentation Requirements

### Package README Structure
Each package must include a comprehensive README.md:

```markdown
# @adobe/react-native-aep{name}

## Description
Brief description of the package functionality and Adobe Experience Platform integration.

## Installation
\`\`\`bash
npm install @adobe/react-native-aep{name}
\`\`\`

## Usage
Basic usage examples with code snippets.

## API Reference
Detailed method documentation with parameters and return types.

## Platform Support
- iOS: Minimum version requirements
- Android: Minimum API level requirements

## Contributing
Reference to [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md)

## License
Apache License 2.0
```

